  "description": "ZUWBOM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H120 N12 O22 Yb4,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Yb01 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb02 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.665-3.925 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.11-111.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C128H120N12O22Yb4·2(C2H3N). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
